{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chards is a strategic card game that you play chess with cards. Although this is a card game, this game has basically <strong>0 RNG mechanic</strong>. This game emphasizes strategic thinking and planing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some <strong>new pieces</strong> are added to the game. You can get them by using card effect or promoting. Use these cards and pieces to craft your own strategy and defeat your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with every card in your main deck already in hand. Every turn, you can make a move and play a card. You play with your hand visible to your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You draw every 2 draw phases. Whenever you draw a card, you draw card from your discard pile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can have up to 8 cards in your main deck, up to 5 pieces in your extra deck. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited number of decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions on deck building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Play (requires running 2 instances of the game)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938820?t=1760076557","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938820?t=1760076557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938820/6df9591d9c95815b9e5b551c7b34c097762de8df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760076557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938820/6df9591d9c95815b9e5b551c7b34c097762de8df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760076557","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","i